# LaTeX by-products; the .aux and .log files are caught by the top-level rules.
# vd_numbers.txt is generated too, but tracked: it is the record of every number
# in the letter. The figures are tracked as PDFs (main.tex needs them); the PNGs
# are previews that figures.py writes beside them.
*.bbl
*.blg
*.fdb_latexmk
*.fls
*.out
*Notes.bib
build*.log
fig_*.png
# the D2Q9 draft's Fig. 1, no longer used
fig_snapshots.pdf
